# This prototype needs no environment variables or secrets. Nothing here is required to run or deploy it.
#
# When you add real payments or an order API later (for example Razorpay):
#   1. Put secret values in Vercel > Project > Settings > Environment Variables,
#      and in a local .env file for development. .env is already gitignored.
#   2. Never give a secret a VITE_ prefix. Vite copies every VITE_ variable into the public JavaScript bundle.
#   3. Read secrets only in server code (a Vercel Function in an /api folder), never in src/.
#
# RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
